SUMMARY:Sam's Gap to Rice Gap 7.5 Mi\, 1700 Ft EG
DESCRIPTION:The Asheville Hiking Group\nWe are headed off in a different d
 irection this week and it about 30 minutes north from the carpool meetup l
 ocation. It is a nice out and back section of the AT starting at Sam's Gap
  and turning around at Rice Gap. The hike will be a total of 7.5 miles\, 1
 700 ft of elevation gain and reach about 4500 ft elevation. We will pass H
 igh Rock and stop at the Hog Back Shelter for a quick lunch on the way bac
 k. There is a custom AllTrails link below. This is a bit of a longer hike 
 with some decent elevation gain so be prepared for a longer day.\n\nhttps:
 //www.alltrails.com/explore/custom-routes/uploaded-route-a0047c1\n\n**CARP
 OOL**\nMeet behind the Earth Fare by the Tesla chargers in WestGate Plaza 
 at 8am. If you want to go directly to the trailhead\, please let me know a
 nd use the directions in AllTrails.\n\n**WEATHER**\nAs usual the weather i
 s a bit uncertain for Monday but I'll watch the weather and post a cancell
 ation message by 7:00 AM if there is a chance of severe weather or lightni
 ng during this time period..\n\n**QUESTIONS?**\nYou can message me through
  MeetUp until 8:00 AM the day of. Cell reception may be sketchy\, but you 
 can try to text or call me up to the start of the hike: (508) 965-2333.\n\
 n**LEGALESE**\nThis Asheville Hiking Group event involves hiking and\, pos
 sibly\, transportation to and from the meetup site. Participants are respo
 nsible for their own safety and affirm that they have the appropriate skil
 ls\, physical conditioning\, equipment\, and supplies. Hiking may involve 
 risks to oneself and property. Neither your hike organizer nor Asheville H
 iking Group can assure your safety nor eliminate all risks. Participants a
 ssume full responsibility for any injuries\, damages\, or losses.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/ashevillehikinggroup/events/316502096
 /
