SUMMARY:Scenic AVL #2 - Warren Wilson Redux
DESCRIPTION:The Asheville Hiking Group\nMostly flat but long double lollip
 op starting in at Berea Baptist Church on Riceville Rd\, passing the Warre
 n Wilson farm and continuing along the river trail.\n\nRating: Moderate\nP
 ace: 3.2 mph\nSurface: Trail\nDistance: 7.5 miles\nElevation Gain: 400 (sh
 ort ups and downs\nWildlife/Animals: Warren Wilson Farm\, college students
 \, often bears.\nDogs: Well behaved dogs are welcome . Conserving Carolina
  preserve requires all dogs to be leashed\n\nWe leave on time\, but if you
  are late\, you can intercept us. I will post Intercept instructions in co
 mments later.\n\nGeneral Rout\n- All Trails[ Ma](https://www.alltrails.com
 /explore/map/warren-wilson-from-berea-baptist-church-96ebc5c)p\n- Start Be
 rea Baptist Church\n\nAfter Eats Mexican food on Tunnel Road or similar\n\
 nScenic Asheville Series: There are 9[ hikes in the series\; hike them all
  a](https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1XUm-X1_OhxKIi8JU5rhjsW37cAl4yY
 x8yB_NEjjI5Lk)nd receive an attractive badge for your backpack\n\nWe will 
 start the hike on time\, no waiting. This hike is long\, and so we need to
  leave on tim\n\nThis is a *mostl*y flat hike\, and we will push the pace 
 to complete in around 2.5 hours. If we run late\, we will short the lollip
 op. If anyone has trouble keeping up\, they will be advised to head back a
 t the halfway point\n\nBring a headlamp\, poles\, jacket\, and snacks\n\nT
 his is a revised version of the original Scenic AVL #2. Thanks to Jeanne S
  from the Mountains to Sea Meetup for making me aware that these trails ar
 e open again ! For those of you who are regulars \, the Waynesville #2 wil
 l be done as a wildcard going forward .
